<app-navigation title="创作资产"/>
<view class="shell asset-library"><view class="heading">我的创作资产</view><view class="sub">作品、灵感、AI交流与拆解，集中查看。</view><view class="storage-note">作品方案、灵感及旧视频索引来自本机；云端文字、图片作品、视频资产和最近100条AI交流按当前账号读取。邮箱资料与作品不会公开。</view><view class="asset-filters"><text wx:for="{{filters}}" wx:key="*this" class="chip {{filter===item?'active':''}}" data-filter="{{item}}" bindtap="filter">{{item}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="muted">正在同步云端资产…</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="asset-error" bindtap="onShow">{{error}} · 点击重试</view><view wx:if="{{detail}}" class="card asset-detail"><view class="row"><view class="strong grow">{{detail.title}}</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="closeDetail">收起</button></view><text class="asset-fulltext" selectable>{{detail.text}}</text><button wx:if="{{detail.kind==='draft'||detail.kind==='idea'}}" class="primary" bindtap="createFromDetail">{{detail.kind==='draft'?'继续编辑':'用这个灵感创作'}}</button></view><view wx:if="{{!visible.length}}" class="card empty">这里还没有资产</view><view class="card asset-item" wx:for="{{visible}}" wx:key="key" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindtap="open"><view class="row"><view class="strong grow">{{item.title}}</view><text class="badge">{{item.label}}</text></view><view class="asset-meta">{{item.preview||'点击查看作品与资产'}}</view><view class="link">{{item.kind==='draft'?'查看创作方案':'查看内容'}} ›</view></view></view>
